            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>安全与请求优化 / Security and request hardening</h2><p>手动订阅迁移至本机钥匙串，限制响应正文为 2 MiB，改进请求取消与失败退避，仅允许同源 HTTPS 重定向。Manual subscriptions migrate to Keychain; response bodies are capped at 2 MiB, cancellation and failure backoff are improved, and redirects are limited to the same HTTPS origin.</p><p>Apple silicon 测试版，Developer ID 签名，尚未 Apple 公证。Apple silicon prerelease, Developer ID signed, not notarized.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/mustundead/ByteKibble/releases/tag/v1.2.0-build50">完整更新说明 / Full release notes</a></p>]]></description>
